# Timeline probe — what a rank is waiting for inside MPI_Waitall

Nsight Systems, `--trace=mpi,cuda`, one report per rank. Durations and
overlaps are per-report (same process, same clock); no cross-rank
timestamp is compared, because nsys clock alignment across nodes is not
good enough to call one rank late by microseconds.

